id: og_pier
name: Pier
description: Pier. A pavilion on legs with a level underneath that has no walls at all, only columns, so the way that cannot be seen is also the way with nothing to hide behind. Built as a pleasure pier; the season ended and the storm boards went up over everything except the far end.

